        "body": "Ericsson LM Telephone Co is a for-profit public company headquartered in Stockholm, Sweden, trading under the ticker ERIC with SEC CIK 0000717826. Its website describes the company as enabling the full value of connectivity and powering networks that connect billions, with work spanning 5G, AI-driven automation, and cloud.\n\nThe company's site says it helps providers and enterprises unlock what connectivity can do, offering secure enterprise connectivity that unites 5G, AI, and cloud. It discusses AI moving into the physical world and the role of communications service providers in the AI economy. The site also presents Ericsson's perspective on 6G as an \"intelligent fabric\" connecting people and machines through mobile, cloud, and AI systems, and mentions advanced 5G capabilities, network slicing, orchestration, and AI-driven tools. It describes AT&T's Open RAN transformation as laying a foundation for an open, disaggregated, and programmable network.\n\nThe available data lists no litigation or product entries.",
